{"id":47647,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sao-silvestre-porto-2026\/"},"modified":"2026-08-27T17:09:37","modified_gmt":"2026-08-27T16:09:37","slug":"sao-silvestre-porto","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sao-silvestre-porto\/","title":{"rendered":"S\u00e3o Silvestre de Porto 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: PROVA S\u00e3o Silvestre de Porto 2026 --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre a <span style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">S\u00e3o Silvestre de Porto 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>S\u00e3o Silvestre de Porto 2026<\/strong> \u00e9 promovida por <strong>Runporto<\/strong>, realizando-se no dia <strong>20\/12\/2026 (Domingo)<\/strong> em Porto (Avenida dos Aliados). O evento \u00e9 uma das refer\u00eancias do calend\u00e1rio desportivo de Dezembro de 2026, reunindo centenas de atletas num ambiente festivo.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Com inscri\u00e7\u00f5es e regulamento confirmados na plataforma <strong>Runporto (runporto.com)<\/strong>, o evento inclui 10 km (Corrida Principal) e 5 km (Caminhada). Explora o nosso guia de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-10km\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 600;\" target=\"_blank\">corridas de 10 km<\/a> e consulta o <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calendario-de-corridas\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 600;\" target=\"_blank\">calend\u00e1rio de corridas de 2026<\/a>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Garante a tua presen\u00e7a e desfruta de um grande evento desportivo.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h3 style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\u26a1 Ficha T\u00e9cnica<\/h3>\n<ul style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 12px; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li style=\"display: flex; gap: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; min-width: 120px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 Data da Prova:<\/strong> <span style=\"color: #CBD5E1;\">20\/12\/2026 (Domingo)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"display: flex; gap: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; min-width: 120px;\">\ud83d\udccd Localidade:<\/strong> <span style=\"color: #CBD5E1;\">Porto (Avenida dos Aliados)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"display: flex; gap: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; min-width: 120px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Dist\u00e2ncias:<\/strong> <span style=\"color: #CBD5E1;\">10 km (Corrida Principal) e 5 km (Caminhada)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"display: flex; gap: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; min-width: 120px;\">\u23f1\ufe0f Hor\u00e1rio Partida:<\/strong> <span style=\"color: #CBD5E1;\">18h00<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"display: flex; gap: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; min-width: 120px;\">\u26f0\ufe0f Piso \/ Relevo:<\/strong> <span style=\"color: #CBD5E1;\">Asfalto e cal\u00e7ada no Centro Hist\u00f3rico do Porto<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"display: flex; gap: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; min-width: 120px;\">\ud83d\udc65 Limite Vagas:<\/strong> <span style=\"color: #CBD5E1;\">15.000 Atletas<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h3 style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\ud83c\udfd4\ufe0f Geometria da Prova &#038; Percurso<\/h3>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O percurso da <strong>S\u00e3o Silvestre de Porto 2026<\/strong> percorre os pontos centrais e envolvente de Porto (Avenida dos Aliados).<\/p>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border-left: 4px solid #8B5CF6; padding: 16px; border-radius: 8px; margin-top: 16px;\">\n<h4 style=\"color: #FFFFFF; margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 16px;\">\ud83c\udf24\ufe0f Clima &#038; Condi\u00e7\u00f5es Previstas da \u00c9poca<\/h4>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; margin: 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;\">Em Dezembro, as temperaturas situam-se habitualmente entre 8\u00b0C e 15\u00b0C, sendo aconselh\u00e1vel aquecimento pr\u00e9vio adequado.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"pr-calc-event-banner\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.12); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 16px; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 24px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div>\n<h4 style=\"color: #FFFFFF; margin: 0 0 6px 0; font-size: 18px;\">\u23f1\ufe0f Prepara o teu ritmo para a S\u00e3o Silvestre de Porto 2026<\/h4>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; margin: 0; font-size: 14px;\">Calcula o teu tempo estimado e parciais com a nossa ferramenta oficial.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8B5CF6 0%, #7C3AED 100%); color: #FFFFFF; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 10px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px;\" target=\"_blank\">Calculadora de Pace \u2192<\/a>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h3 style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\ud83c\udfe8 Onde Ficar (Alojamento Recomendado)<\/h3>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Para apoiar a log\u00edstica dos atletas em <strong>Porto (Avenida dos Aliados)<\/strong>, recomendamos a reserva nas seguintes zonas estrat\u00e9gicas:<\/p>\n<ul style=\"color: #CBD5E1; line-height: 1.7; padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Avenida dos Aliados &#038; Pra\u00e7a do Munic\u00edpio:<\/strong> Pr\u00f3ximo da partida e meta para desloca\u00e7\u00f5es a p\u00e9.<\/li>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Ribeira, Cordoaria &#038; Cl\u00e9rigos:<\/strong> Centro hist\u00f3rico e \u00e1rea de restaura\u00e7\u00e3o regional.<\/li>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Trindade &#038; Bolh\u00e3o (n\u00f3 central do Metro):<\/strong> Acessos rodovi\u00e1rios principais e vias de transporte.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h3 style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\ud83c\udf0d Sobre o Local &#038; Gastronomia Regional<\/h3>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Visite o patrim\u00f3nio local (Avenida dos Aliados, Torre dos Cl\u00e9rigos, Esta\u00e7\u00e3o de S\u00e3o Bento e Ponte Lu\u00eds I) e saboreie as especialidades da regi\u00e3o: <strong>Francesinha, Tripas \u00e0 Moda do Porto, Broa de Avintes e Vinho do Porto<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-section\" style=\"margin-top: 32px;\">\n<h3 style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">Perguntas <span style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes<\/span><\/h3>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer;\">1. Qual \u00e9 a data e o hor\u00e1rio de partida da S\u00e3o Silvestre de Porto 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 1.6;\">A prova realiza-se no dia <strong>20\/12\/2026 (Domingo)<\/strong> em <strong>Porto (Avenida dos Aliados)<\/strong>, com a partida marcada para as <strong>18h00<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer;\">2. Onde \u00e9 feito o levantamento do kit de atleta e dorsal?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 1.6;\">O secretariado funciona no <strong>Alameda Shopping (junto ao Est\u00e1dio do Drag\u00e3o)<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer;\">3. Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e o tipo de piso do percurso?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 1.6;\">A prova apresenta as dist\u00e2ncias de <strong>10 km (Corrida Principal) e 5 km (Caminhada)<\/strong>, disputadas em piso de <strong>Asfalto e cal\u00e7ada no Centro Hist\u00f3rico do Porto<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer;\">4. Onde posso consultar os resultados e fotos oficiais da prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 1.6;\">As classifica\u00e7\u00f5es finais e a galeria de fotografias oficiais poder\u00e3o ser acedidas no portal <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\" target=\"_blank\">Portugal Running<\/a> ap\u00f3s o encerramento do evento.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer;\">5. A prova disponibiliza abastecimentos e apoio aos atletas?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 1.6;\">Sim, a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o disponibiliza <strong>\u00c1gua ao km 5 e abastecimento natal\u00edcio na meta<\/strong>, al\u00e9m de cobertura de seguro desportivo e apoio m\u00e9dico.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- FIM BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: PROVA S\u00e3o Silvestre de Porto 2026 --><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":60825,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[47,672,27,28,478],"event_type_2":[24,726,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_